wuerde keine Zuordnung vorschlagen, weil Mittelzuweisung an Behoerden keine Regulierung der Sicherheitsdienstleister ist."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4914,"cache_read_input_tokens":20322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4914},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","uuid":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","timestamp":"2026-10-24T00:36:08.952Z","request_id":"req_000000","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_000000":{"unit_id":"senate--appropriations--department-of-homeland-security","decision":"mapped","no_mapping_reason":null,"broad_scope_exception":false,"broad_scope_reason":null,"assignments":[{"industry_id":"security-protection-services","evidence_excerpt":"Recherche","rationale_short":"Der Subcommittee on Department of Homeland Security finanziert das DHS, und die Recherche zeigt die Anhoerung \"A Review of the President's Fiscal Year 2027 Budget Request for the Department of Homeland Security\" (2026) sowie die Debatte um die Finanzierung von ICE-Haftplaetzen im FY2026-Heimatschutzgesetz. Private Betreiber von Haftanstalten (\"detention and correction facilities\") haengen wesentlich von diesen Mitteln ab, sodass die Mittelzuweisung ihre Nachfrage einstufig bestimmt."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.appropriations.senate.gov/hearings/a-review-of-the-presidents-fiscal-year-2027-budget-request-for-the-department-of-homeland-security","belegt":"Anhoerung des Subcommittee zum Haushaltsantrag des Praesidenten fuer das FY2027 des Department of Homeland Security (Juni 2026, Vorsitz Katie Britt)."},{"url":"https://humanrightsfirst.org/library/stop-enabling-ices-dangerous-detention-and-reckless-deportat